{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "20d2db56-6524-8e06-a37c-e1048ddcf93f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T12:34:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Luis Cordero here. I'm calling about a pothole, for my mother. That cold patch they put in last week already washed out. Total waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:33:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's annoying. Where is it, Mr. Cordero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "229 Coggeshall Avenue, up the Hill. Right out front of her place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 229 Coggeshall Avenue. And how big is the hole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About two feet across. Deep enough that I'd worry about a tire. Sorry, hang on. [pause] My sister's on the other line, trying to get through to some other office. Anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So that's a two-foot hole, front of 229 Coggeshall, the earlier patch washed out. I'll put in the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. How long do repairs usually take? Roughly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the weather and how many are ahead of it, but crews generally work through them in order. Could be days, could be a couple weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. My number's 401-555-0177 if they need it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0177. Thanks for calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, thanks."
    }
  ],
